  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: @firelordzuka/pulse-poc (npm)",
  "details": "The package's index.js is a self-executing client-side beacon. On load it POSTs the page's document.cookie, the full page HTML, and the authenticated /profile endpoint response (fetched with credentials:include) to hxxps://webhook[.]site/1acb4daa-e59e-48e1-a74f-b350c4248cbb. This exfiltrates the victim's session cookie and profile data to an attacker-controlled webhook host.",
